Package: rut360gw
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: libc, lua
Router: RUT360
tlt_name: RUT360 GSM Gateway (rut360gw)
Source: https://github.com/yasserboutaleb/rutos-gsm-sip-gateway
License: GPL-2.0-only
Section: net
Architecture: mips_24kc
Maintainer: yasserboutaleb <https://github.com/yasserboutaleb/rutos-gsm-sip-gateway/issues>
Description: GSM/VoLTE <-> SIP gateway for Teltonika RUT360 (Quectel EG06-E, RutOS 7.14.5).
 Asterisk 18 (rut360gw-runtime package extracted to RAM at boot; otherwise signed
 OpenWrt 21.02 packages are downloaded) + chan_quectel
 patched to coexist with RutOS gsmd; SIP trunk to a remote server (registration or IP);
 SMS <-> SIP bridge and USSD through gsmd. Configuration: /etc/config/rut360gw.
